2 CONT NOTE: as #2, PC #29, same person as No.2 on Ped Ch # 31 OCCUPATION: Operator of Nordsveen farm 1612-1624.  He and children are among hiers of Madame Dorthe Pederdatter of Fladager farm in Sunnfjord.
2 CONT Oluf Torstensen Nøttestad farm Ringnes farm is a farm in Krødsherad . The farm is located on the west side of the lake Krøderen northern part, near the ski resort Norefjell . The name occurs first in a "letter," (diploma) from 17.
