1 NAME Jørgen Hansen /Falster/
2 GIVN Jørgen Hansen
2 SURN Falster
2 _MARNM Falster
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1664
2 PLAC Frøya (Uttian), Trøndelag, Norge
