1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lars Smith''' (1708-1730) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Student 1723. In 1730 he died of tuberculosis in Fejø, while he was visiting the priest Mr. [http://www.geni.com/people/Hans-Meyer/6000000021120784889 Hans Meyer], who was married to his first cousin [http://www.geni.com/people/Mi
2 CONC lle-Susanne-Munthe/6000000021106779747 Mille Susanne Munthe].
2 CONT
2 CONT I have searched for Lars Smith´s death in 1730 Fejø, Fuglse, Maribo, but found nothing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Even if he too might have been brought to København to be buried in the church Vor Frue, I think that his information should have been written in the Fejø church book. (Not found)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Kilder===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Forfatter, Christopher Giessing (1723-1791): [http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000021108124479 Smith-Kaasbøll stammen]
