2 DATE 26 DEC 1774
1 OCCU sokneprest i Hammerfest. 
2 DATE 1 DEC 1779
1 OCCU sokneprest i Folden
2 DATE 8 OCT 1784
1 OCCU sokneprest i Alstahaug. 
2 DATE 15 MAY 1801
1 OCCU sogneprest i Gildeskål
2 DATE 1805
